WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
Ryu advances in the recorded raw Drive Rush.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.100
Crouching medium punch interrupts the Rush approach.

3
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.750
Crouching medium kick links after the counter hit.

4
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.300
The cancel-Rush crouching medium punch connects.

5
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:02.900
Crouching heavy punch links into Bakkai.

6
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.100
Heavy Bakkai continues the conversion.

7
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.550
Ryu lands after the Bakkai sequence.
